rice&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZGRP&quot; then &quot;Customer group pric&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZMAP&quot; then &quot;Moving average price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZMCP&quot; then &quot;Price (Gross)&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZMCT&quot; then &quot;Planned Metal Price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZMMP&quot; then &quot;Metal Market Price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZORD&quot; then &quot;Order specific price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPA1&quot; then &quot;Copy of price agreem&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPA2&quot; then &quot;Pricing Ptnr Agrmnt&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPAD&quot; then &quot;Pricing Agrmnt Adj&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPAG&quot; then &quot;Pricing Agreement&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPAO&quot; then &quot;Price agreem. o/ride&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPAR&quot; then &quot;POS Act Resale Price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPAS&quot; then &quot;Pricing Agrt Sls Org&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPB1&quot; then &quot;Price Override CSA&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPB2&quot; then &quot;Price Override MCP&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPCF&quot; then &quot;Price code factors&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPCO&quot; then &quot;Price code fact copy&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPCP&quot; then &quot;Profit Centre Price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPDY&quot; then &quot;Proof of Delivery&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPEP&quot; then &quot;POS Exception Price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPGG&quot; then &quot;Pricing Agrt-Mat Grp&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPGM&quot; then &quot;Pricing Agrt-Mat.&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPOM&quot; then &quot;PriceAgrt o/ride-Mat&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPPD&quot; then &quot;Prompt payment disc&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPPY&quot; then &quot;Prepayment %&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPRD&quot; then &quot;Project discount&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPRG&quot; then &quot;Proj.price by group&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPRH&quot; then &quot;Product Hierarchy&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPRP&quot; then &quot;Project Price&quot;&#13;&#10;When &quot;ZPRT&quot; then &quot;P